 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+- `EncodeSixel` no longer boxes a `color.Color` for every pixel when it builds
+  its palette and quantises the picture, nor formats numbers with
+  `fmt.Sprintf` per colour and run: `BenchmarkEncodeSixel` went from ~51,000
+  allocations to 11, and a 480×384 frame makes 41. The output is unchanged
+  byte for byte (#59).
